AWS Glue Iceberg Catalog Setup for OLake Go | OLake > Troubleshooting
Cause: IAM role or user lacks required permissions for AWS Glue or S3 operations.
Fix: Ensure your IAM policy includes necessary Glue permissions: json {   "Version": "2012-10-17",   "Statement": [     {       "Effect": "Allow",       "Action": [         "glue:CreateDatabase",         "glue:GetDatabase",         "glue:CreateTable",         "glue:GetTable",         "glue:GetTables",         "glue:UpdateTable",         "glue:GetPartitions"       ],       "Resource": "*"     }   ] } Add S3 permissions for the warehouse path: json {   "Effect": "Allow",   "Action": [     "s3:GetObject",     "s3:PutObject",     "s3:DeleteObject",     "s3:ListBucket"   ],   "Resource": [     "arn:aws:s3:::your-bucket-name/*",     "arn:aws:s3:::your-bucket-name"   ] }
Ensure your IAM policy includes necessary Glue permissions: json {   "Version": "2012-10-17",   "Statement": [     {       "Effect": "Allow",       "Action": [         "glue:CreateDatabase",         "glue:GetDatabase",         "glue:CreateTable",         "glue:GetTable",         "glue:GetTables",         "glue:UpdateTable",         "glue:GetPartitions"       ],       "Resource": "*"     }   ] }

AWS Glue Iceberg Catalog Setup for OLake Go | OLake > Troubleshooting
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "glue:CreateDatabase",
        "glue:GetDatabase",
        "glue:CreateTable",
        "glue:GetTable",
        "glue:GetTables",
        "glue:UpdateTable",
        "glue:GetPartitions"
      ],
      "Resource": "*"
    }
  ]
}
